      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont really know why im even typing this. everything just feels so fast now. i look around and i dont recognize anything anymore. it feels like the world just... moved on and left me behind in the dust. like i'm just a ghost walking around in a world that doesnt have a place for me. its just so tiring.",
